# Pairs with ModeReResolvedLocally. A mode disagreement on an enrolled tree is
# silently dropped, losing the entries instead of parking them for an operator.
MODULE: ReceiverModeMismatchDropped
TARGET: ModeReResolvedLocally
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a wire-mode disagreement is dropped rather than dead-lettered
PERTURBS: ApplyRun

--- FIND
THEN "applied" ELSE "deadLettered"
--- REPLACE
THEN "applied" ELSE "dropped"
--- END